<title>USA: SELECTIVE INSURANCE NAMES MURPHY PRESIDENT.</title>
<headline>SELECTIVE INSURANCE NAMES MURPHY PRESIDENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHVILLE, N.J. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selective Insurance Group Inc said Gregory Murphy has been appointed president, chief operating officer and a director.</p>
<p>Murphy was most recently Selective's senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Selective chairman and chief and executive officer, James Entringer, formerly also held the title of president.</p>
<p>Chief operating officer is a new position. Thursday, 12 June 1997 17:48:39 ENDS  nN1269308</p>
